maluos-desk (0.5.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Phase 13 slice 1 (docs/phase13-slice1-nodes.md): the office client is
    the shared one in maluos-estate (maluos_estate.client), which this
    package now depends on; the mock office lives there too and
    maluos_desk.mock_office names the same module. `maluctl office estate
    [--json] [--refresh]`: the estate as this desk's owner may see it
    (endpoints.estate, published to system managers), cached per user
    for a minute: nodes with health and summary, the open alerts, counts.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:00:00 +0000

maluos-desk (0.4.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Phase 12 slice 9: the public MaluApps catalogue is verified:
    catalog.json.asc (a detached signature by the MaluOS release key)
    is fetched beside it and checked with gpgv against the archive
    keyring; unsigned or invalid, the public half is refused (the last
    verified copy is served marked stale). MALUOS_APPS_KEYRING overrides
    the keyring for tests.
  * `maluctl office agent ID send` prints a streamed answer as it grows.
  * The mock office's agent page signs the desk in from the Bearer header
    ("signed in as EMAIL") and sets a session cookie for later loads.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 01:06:51 +0000

maluos-desk (0.3.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The office's agents (Phase 12 slice 8): `maluctl office agents` lists
    the directory the office publishes to this desk (endpoints.agents,
    cached per user), `maluctl office agent ID card|send|tasks|activity`
    talks to one over its task URL (maluos_agent_tasks) with the desk
    token. The mock office serves two agents, their activity, their task
    interface and an HTML page each.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

maluos-desk (0.2.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * MaluApps (Phase 12 slice 7): `maluctl office apps [--json] [--refresh]`
    merges the office's catalogue (the contract's new endpoints.apps, GET
    /api/v1/desks/apps with the desk token) over the public one
    (download.maluos.com/apps/catalog.json), cached per user for 15 min and
    served stale when both are unreachable; `apps install|remove|open ID`:
    a web app becomes a launcher (~/.local/share/applications/maluapp-ID.desktop)
    opening it in Firefox's own window, a deb app installs from the MaluOS
    repository through pkexec apt-get. The mock office serves four apps.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:10:00 +0000

